# Two dynamic elements combine their stored subtypes

Verifies adding two dynamically indexed elements resolves the operation from
both stored subtypes, so a millimeter and a centimeter sum to `30mm`.

>>> source
let left: int[] = [10mm]
let right: int[] = [2cm]
let index = 0
print(left[index] + right[index])

<<< stdout
30mm

<<< stderr
